#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/best-practice/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Documentation changes over time, and links and cross-references can become "
"challenging manage for various reasons. Here is a set of best practices "
"explaining and addressing these challenges."
msgstr "文档会随时间变化，链接和交叉引用可能因各种原因变得难以管理。这里有一组最佳实践用于解释和应对这些挑战。"

